&lt;h3&gt;Core capabilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;LC-MS/MS and GC-MS workflows&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;MALDI imaging and spatial omics&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Multiplex biomarker analysis&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Proteomics and metabolomics data integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;





Research focus


We investigate how viral infection, immune regulation, and cancer biology intersect across molecular, cellular, and systems levels.




Core services


Our work supports discovery and validation pipelines for biomarker identification, tissue imaging, and high-throughput omics analysis.




Collaboration


We partner with investigators across oncology, immunology, and translational science to accelerate discovery and application.




